Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"}," to resupply and sell exotic trade goods captured from other civilizations in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Ebon Strikers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Ebon_Strikers","referenceId":"reference:9a37505b7daeb2e5"}," sometimes raid Crimson Star flotillas returning from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},", causing brief skirmishes to break out in the space above ",{"tag":"a","children":["Volik"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Volik","referenceId":"reference:24aae6e1e2447b18"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"br","children":[]},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
